// The annotation `null | null` — the `null` unit type joined with itself. Filed as D4673,
// CLOSED: a `null` member of an annotated union joins the niche, so the annotation is the
// `null` type and `x` takes the cell `x: null` does. Kept as the probe that it keeps running.
// Should print true.
function f(x: null | null) { print(x == null) }
f(null)
